  message: "confidence:F1 multimodal table DONE (merged selfh/dev 51a4a2fc2a). Step 1 of this WI complete: added base_confidence_unresolved + is_resolved conditioning for the 2 high-volume call types (ast_call_direct 0.85/0.50, ast_call 0.85/0.40), verified bimodal on the live is_resolved x confidence cross-tab. The derivation TABLE now covers the highest-volume edge types (single-valued + multimodal) -- still not wired, no published value changes. REMAINING: (2) Edge.create default flip (change the flat 0.85 confidence default to a sentinel so Edge.create derives when no explicit confidence is passed); (3) confidence_source discriminator + per-producer migration; (4) range validation. Re-scoping note: the seeded types' producers currently pass EXPLICIT values that already match the registry, so the flip+migration is mostly de-duplication with minor-cohort normalization (e.g. ast_call_direct's 292 edges at 0.7 -> 0.85), NOT a 44k-edge value overhaul. confidence_model v1->v2 bump rides the flip."  # 386e
