  message: "PR1 (confidence table) DONE — merged selfh 043cff6738. Human rulings applied: proceed now, hybrid numbers, v2 bump (deferred to PR2). Centralized _CONFIDENCE_SEEDS overlay added to evidence_types.py: seeded base_confidence count 10 -> 75 (65 new single-valued inference pathways). Each value = edge-weighted modal confidence its producers currently hardcode (corpus-dominant; AST-scan site modal fallback for non-self-corpus pathways). Constraints enforced by tests: inference_pathway axis only, 0.30-0.95 band, disjoint from the inline-seeded specs. NO published value change (seeds only affect omit-confidence edges, dominated by already-seeded ast_call_direct); broad suite 4657 passed.\n\nDEFERRED (NOT seeded — separate producer-side ceiling-fix): four 1.0-modal pathways breach the 0.95 reserved ceiling and must be lowered at the producer, not enshrined as a base: naming_convention (1.0, ~19k `contains` edges — the dominant ceiling-breach; note the evidence_type=naming_convention on `contains` edges also looks like a producer mislabel worth a separate look), build_dependency, subdir_include, tree_sitter. Their producers keep explicit confidence in PR2 (not migrated).\n\nNEXT — PR2 (the value-moving producer migration): drop the literal `confidence=` at the 305 Edge.create sites whose evidence_type is a literal SEEDED pathway (keep the 173 computed-confidence sites; keep computed-evidence_type sites; keep the 4 deferred-type sites). Net ~5% edge movement, dominated by the intended ast_call resolved spread-collapse (0.95->0.85) + unresolved (0.5->0.4). confidence_model v1->v2 bump rides PR2. Then range-validation gate (advisory) + close INV-suvil with before->after distribution evidence."  # ae98
